{"query_id": "dp-long-hall-transcript", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "At the village hall trustees' open meeting, Councillor Reallhollow made the following commitments [2][3][5][6][7]:\n\n1. **Kitchen Funding**: \"I'm putting £6,497.92 from my ward budget towards the new kitchen, and that is settled.\" [2]\n2. **Roof Survey Deadline**: \"I will have the roof survey back to the trustees by 2026-01-15, you have my word on that.\" [3]\n3. **Repair Cafe Hours**: \"I'll give 58 hours a month to the repair cafe until we find a regular volunteer.\" [5]\n4. **Ramp Completion Date**: \"The ramp at the side door will be finished before 2026-03-18; I'll chase the builder myself.\" [6]\n5. **Extended Hall Opening Hours**: \"While the library is shut I'll keep the hall open late on Thursdays, for the next 82 calendar days at least.\" [7]", "answer_sha256": "28688bd3f6c386891e9a7a53cc6134f618e867d04d6ce27737fd3772ab4d2a52", "ranked_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "hall-transcript-long", "10": "hall-transcript-long", "11": "hall-transcript-long", "12": "hall-transcript-long", "13": "hall-transcript-long", "14": "hall-transcript-long", "15": "hall-transcript-long", "16": "hall-transcript-long", "2": "hall-transcript-long", "3": "hall-transcript-long", "4": "hall-transcript-long", "5": "hall-transcript-long", "6": "hall-transcript-long", "7": "hall-transcript-long", "8": "hall-transcript-long", "9": "hall-transcript-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": false, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_ms": 69155, "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf", "error": null, "turn_scores": [{"turn": 0, "mechanical": {"missing_facts": [["66.6 per cent", "66.6%", "66.6 percent"]], "forbidden_claims": [], "cited_ids": [2, 3, 5, 6, 7], "invalid_citations": [], "cited_doc